Note: list construction, filtering, and reduction chained together
nums = [5, 3, 8, 1, 9, 2]
Say sorted(nums)
Say nums.filter(given x return x > 3)
Say nums.map(given x return x * 2)
Say sum(nums)
doubled = nums.map(given x return x + x)
Say doubled.filter(given x return x > 10)
Say "max is " + max(nums)
Say "how many: " + nums.length
